stream
BT 0.20 0.31 0.24 rg /F1 21 Tf 54 748 Td (The Quiet Garden) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 11 Tf 54 732 Td (A short story by Mira Sol) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td () Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 700 Td (The work was small and ordinary. They loosened the hard earth, pulled the weeds,) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 684 Td (and carried water in old jars. Nobody agreed on where the path should go. Mira) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (drew three plans, then let the rain wash them away. In the end they left a little) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 652 Td (space wherever someone needed to step.) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 636 Td () Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 620 Td (By June, yellow flowers nodded beside the bench. The patch did not fix the noisy) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 604 Td (buses or make the rent cheaper. But people who had only traded hurried nods began) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 588 Td (to stop. They learned names. They shared mint tea. When a heat wave came, they) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 572 Td (took turns watering before breakfast.) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 556 Td () Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 540 Td (A boy from the next block brought a small tomato plant. It bent in the wind, so) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 524 Td (Mr. Lee cut a slat from a shipping crate and tied it gently to the stem. Jo) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 508 Td (planted mint in a tin pot so it would not take over the whole bed.) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 492 Td () Tj ET
BT 0.55 0.55 0.50 rg /F1 9 Tf 540 30 Td (2 / 3) Tj ET
