BT 0.20 0.31 0.24 rg /F1 21 Tf 54 748 Td (The Quiet Garden) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 11 Tf 54 732 Td (A short story by Mira Sol) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td () Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 700 Td (One evening, Mira found the old sign propped against the bench. Someone had) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 684 Td (crossed out KEEP OFF and written TAKE CARE. She sat down beside it. For the first) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (time, the garden felt less like a place she had made and more like a place that) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 652 Td (had made room for everyone.) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 636 Td () Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 620 Td (The following spring, the neighbors met again before the first warm weekend. They) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 604 Td (brought seeds, a thermos of coffee, and a list of small jobs. Remy had grown tall) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 588 Td (enough to write the new sign without standing on a box. This time it read: TAKE) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 572 Td (WHAT YOU NEED. LEAVE ROOM TO GROW.) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 556 Td () Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 540 Td (Mira still passed the garden on her way to the bus. Some mornings she only waved.) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 524 Td (Other mornings she stayed to pull a weed or listen to a story. The patch remained) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 508 Td (small, but the circle around it kept widening.) Tj ET
BT 0.18 0.18 0.16 rg /F1 10 Tf 54 492 Td () Tj ET
